[00:21.930]Isn't it so incredible (这难道不令人难以置信吗)
[00:26.820]We're here sharing the same time and space (我们此刻共享着同一时空)
[00:32.762]In your eyes, the sparks look like (你们眼中的火花看起来像)
[00:37.181]thousands of bright stars I have gazed at for thousands of time (我凝望了数千次的数千颗璀璨的星星)
[00:43.285]May all your sweet dreams take flight (愿你们所有的美梦都能展翅翱翔)
[00:45.909]With the truth to be your guiding light (让真理成为你们的指路明灯)
[00:48.917]Let your curiosity set your spirit free and wild like fire (让你们的好奇心释放你们的灵魂，像火一样自由奔放)
[00:54.066]If the lonely nights are price to see (如果孤独的夜晚)
[00:56.654]Our dreams glowing brightly (是让我们的梦想熠熠生辉的代价)
[00:59.105]Every second is worth it (那每一秒的孤独都值得)
[01:03.382]You built a world of miracles so mundane but precious (你们构建了一个充满奇迹的世界，如常却珍贵)
[01:09.117]The stream of shimmering daily moments returned weight to my soul (那闪烁的瞬间之流，让我的灵魂重新有了重量)
[01:14.079]And stopped me from drifting (让我停止徘徊游移)
[01:16.171]Gave my feet the solid ground to stand (给了我的双脚坚实的立足点)
[01:18.795]So let's sing together (我们一起歌唱吧)
[01:20.449]Every light I'm giving all comes back to you (我发出的每一道光都会回到你身边)
[01:24.173]comes back to you (回到你身边)
[01:46.720]Like diamonds, they need a light to shine (就像钻石需要光才能闪耀)
[01:52.277]I was a shadow until you looked my way (你看向我之前我一直是个影子)
[01:57.914]The rainbows I held inside (我心中珍藏的彩虹)
[02:02.521]Got kissed by sunshine now they can fly in the flowery skies (如今被阳光亲吻后能在繁花飞舞的天空中翱翔)
[02:08.745]Rhythms were beating in my heart (节奏曾在我心中跃动)
[02:11.479]Tunes were ringing in my ears non-stop (曲调曾在我耳边不停地回响)
[02:13.903]That moment I found you (我找到你的那一刻)
[02:16.426]They turned into a song that I could sing out (它们变成了一首我能唱出来的歌)
[02:19.347]If it takes all those lonely nights (如果要经历所有那些孤独的夜晚)
[02:22.146]Just to see you smile tonight (才能看到你今晚的笑容)
[02:24.767]Then it's all been worth it (那么这一切就都值得)
